1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,703
Phloem carries food, mostly sucrose, from where it is made to where it is used.

2
00:00:05,703 --> 00:00:10,950
And unlike xylem, it can carry it in either direction, up or down.

3
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:18,320
Its main cells are sieve tube elements, joined end to end through perforated cross walls called sieve plates.

